        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add publisher constant to deep-thinking agents",
        "summary": "Added `publisher` field to AgentDefinition in six deep-thinking agent files. Files: .agents/deep-thinking/deep-thinker.ts, deepest-thinker.ts, gemini-thinker-high.ts, gemini-thinker.ts, gpt5-thinker.ts, sonnet-thinker.ts. Import `publisher` from ../constants and set on definition object.",
