      "eli5": {
        "text": "The deep-thinking assistants now carry a label that identifies who published them. If you looked at one of these assistants, you would see a publisher field set to a shared value across all six of them, instead of the field being missing or inconsistent. This change is already live and only organizes how the assistants report who put them out there.",
