        "summary": "Removed `common/src/templates/dynamic-agent-functions.ts` (130 lines) containing `collectAgentIds` and `validateAgents`. Analysis notes indicate this file was a duplicate, implying its logic exists elsewhere. Scope limited to `common` package templates directory.",
