      "eli5": {
        "text": "A duplicate assistant-checking helper was removed from the shared toolkit that both agents and the main program use, so only the primary copy of that validation logic remains. This is behind-the-scenes cleanup that doesn't change any visible behavior today, but it reduces maintenance confusion. If you looked at the project's internal files, you'd see one fewer file where the same check was duplicated.",
